  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8502.02 Authority of Bureau Personnel. Persons shall obey all requests made by authorized bureau personnel in matters of public interest, public safety, or resources protection.\n\nSource. #7796, eff 12-2-02; ss by #9478, eff 5-23-09; ss by #10905, eff 8-5-15",
